msgstr "Bucket"

#: includes/class-admin.php:416
msgid "Access key id"
msgstr "ID ng access key"

#: includes/class-admin.php:417
msgid "Secret access key"
msgstr "Lihim na access key"

#: includes/class-admin.php:417
msgid "Leave empty to keep the saved key"
msgstr "Iwanang blangko upang panatilihin ang naka-save na key"

#: includes/class-admin.php:418
msgid "For Cloudflare R2: in the Cloudflare dashboard open R2, create a bucket, then “Manage R2 API tokens” → create a token with Object Read & Write for that bucket, and copy the access key id and secret here."
msgstr "Para sa Cloudflare R2: sa Cloudflare dashboard, buksan ang R2, gumawa ng bucket, pagkatapos ay “Manage R2 API tokens” → gumawa ng token na may Object Read & Write para sa bucket na iyon, at kopyahin ang access key id at secret dito."

#: includes/class-admin.php:421
msgid "Dropbox app key"
msgstr "Key ng Dropbox app"

#: includes/class-admin.php:422
msgid "Create an app at dropbox.com/developers/apps (Scoped access, App folder) with the files.content.read, files.content.write and files.metadata.read permissions, and copy its App key here. Save, then press Connect."
msgstr "Gumawa ng app sa dropbox.com/developers/apps (Scoped access, App folder) na may mga pahintulot na files.content.read, files.content.write, at files.metadata.read, at kopyahin ang App key nito rito. I-save, pagkatapos ay pindutin ang Connect."

#: includes/class-admin.php:424
msgid "OAuth client id"
msgstr "OAuth client ID"

#: includes/class-admin.php:425
msgid "OAuth client secret"
msgstr "Lihim ng client ng OAuth"

#: includes/class-admin.php:425
msgid "Leave empty to keep the saved secret"
msgstr "Iwanang blangko upang panatilihin ang naka-save na lihim"

#: includes/class-admin.php:426
msgid "In Google Cloud Console, enable the Google Drive API, then create an OAuth client of type “Web application” with this address as an authorised redirect URI:"
msgstr "Sa Google Cloud Console, i-enable ang Google Drive API, pagkatapos ay gumawa ng OAuth client na may uri na \"Web application\" gamit ang address na ito bilang awtorisadong redirect URI:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:426
msgid "Save, then press Connect. The plugin only sees the files it creates."
msgstr "I-save, pagkatapos ay pindutin ang Ikonekta. Nakikita lang ng plugin ang mga file na nililikha nito."

#: includes/class-admin.php:428
msgid "Folder inside the storage (optional)"
msgstr "Folder sa loob ng storage (opsyonal)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:429
msgid "Save storage"
msgstr "Magtipid ng storage"

#: includes/class-admin.php:439
msgid "Import a backup from another plugin or host"
msgstr "Mag-import ng backup mula sa ibang plugin o host"

#: includes/class-admin.php:440
msgid "Bring a site in from a backup made by UpdraftPlus, All-in-One WP Migration (.wpress), Duplicator (zip), BackWPup, WPvivid, Jetpack VaultPress Backup, BlogVault, Zinn® Migrate, or any zip/tar archive of a WordPress site with its .sql dump. The content goes into wp-content and the database replaces this site’s; addresses are changed to this site’s automatically."
msgstr "Mag-import ng site mula sa isang backup na ginawa ng UpdraftPlus, All-in-One WP Migration (.wpress), Duplicator (zip), BackWPup, WPvivid, Jetpack VaultPress Backup, BlogVault, Zinn® Migrate, o anumang zip/tar archive ng isang WordPress site kasama ang .sql dump nito. Mapupunta ang nilalaman sa wp-content at papalitan ng database ang sa site na ito; awtomatikong papalitan ang mga address upang itugma sa site na ito."

#: includes/class-admin.php:442
msgid "Upload from your computer"
msgstr "Mag-upload mula sa iyong computer"

#: includes/class-admin.php:442
msgid "Choose every file of the backup at once (UpdraftPlus makes several). Large files are sent in small pieces, so your host’s upload limit does not apply."
msgstr "Piliin ang bawat file ng backup nang sabay-sabay (gumagawa ang UpdraftPlus ng ilan). Ipinapadala ang malalaking file sa maliliit na piraso, kaya hindi nalalapat ang limitasyon sa pag-upload ng iyong host."

#: includes/class-admin.php:443
msgid "Or from links (Google Drive, Dropbox or any download address)"
msgstr "O mula sa mga link (Google Drive, Dropbox, o anumang download address)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:443
msgid "One link per line. For Google Drive and Dropbox, share the file with “anyone with the link” and paste that link; turn sharing off again afterwards."
msgstr "Isang link bawat linya. Para sa Google Drive at Dropbox, ibahagi ang file sa \"sinumang may link\" at i-paste ang link na iyon; i-off muli ang pagbabahagi pagkatapos."

#: includes/class-admin.php:445
msgid "Or a file already on this server"
msgstr "O isang file na nasa server na ito"

#. translators: %s: folder path.
#: includes/class-admin.php:453
#, php-format
msgid "Upload archives by FTP or your host’s file manager into %s and reload this page."
msgstr "Mag-upload ng mga archive sa pamamagitan ng FTP o file manager ng iyong host sa %s at i-reload ang pahinang ito."

#: includes/class-admin.php:458
msgid "Or a deploy code from another site"
msgstr "O isang deploy code mula sa ibang site"

#: includes/class-admin.php:458
msgid "If another site gave you a Zinn® Backups deploy code, paste it here to copy that backup onto this site without sharing its storage keys. A code works for a few hours; treat it like a password."
msgstr "Kung binigyan ka ng isa pang site ng Zinn® Backups deploy code, i-paste ito rito upang kopyahin ang backup na iyon sa site na ito nang hindi ibinabahagi ang mga storage key nito. Gumagana ang code sa loob ng ilang oras; ituring ito tulad ng isang password."

#: includes/class-admin.php:458
msgid "Passphrase (only if that backup is encrypted)"
msgstr "Passphrase (kung naka-encrypt lang ang backup na iyon)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:459
#: includes/class-admin.php:461
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Mag-import"

#: includes/class-admin.php:460
msgid "I understand the import replaces this site’s content and database. After it, sign in with an account from the imported site."
msgstr "Naiintindihan ko na papalitan ng pag-import ang nilalaman at database ng site na ito. Pagkatapos nito, mag-sign in gamit ang isang account mula sa na-import na site."

#: includes/class-admin.php:463
msgid "Moving to Zinn® hosting?"
msgstr "Lumilipat sa hosting ng Zinn®?"

#: includes/class-admin.php:463
msgid "Zinn Digital® can move your site for you from your old host. If your old host gives you no FTP, SSH or control-panel access, install Zinn® Migrate on the old site; it makes one archive you can import here or hand to Zinn®."
msgstr "Maaaring ilipat ng Zinn Digital® ang iyong site mula sa iyong lumang host para sa iyo. Kung ang iyong lumang host ay hindi nagbibigay sa iyo ng access sa FTP, SSH o control-panel, i-install ang Zinn® Migrate sa lumang site; gumagawa ito ng isang archive na maaari mong i-import dito o ibigay sa Zinn®."

#: includes/class-admin.php:473
msgid "What goes into a backup"
msgstr "Kung ano ang kasama sa isang backup"

#: includes/class-admin.php:474
msgid "Include WordPress’s own files (wp-admin, wp-includes). Usually not needed: WordPress can always be reinstalled."
msgstr "Isama ang sariling mga file ng WordPress (wp-admin, wp-includes). Karaniwang hindi kinakailangan: laging maaaring muling i-install ang WordPress."

#: includes/class-admin.php:475
msgid "Also leave out these folders or files (one per line, relative to the WordPress folder)"
msgstr "Iwanan din ang mga folder o file na ito (isa bawat linya, may kaugnayan sa WordPress folder)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:476
msgid "Always left out: caches, update scratch space, and other backup plugins’ own archive folders:"
msgstr "Palaging hindi kasama: mga cache, espasyo para sa update scratch, at sariling mga archive folder ng iba pang backup plugin:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:477
msgid "Size of each part (MB)"
msgstr "Laki ng bawat bahagi (MB)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:478
#: includes/class-plugin.php:116
msgid "Keep backups running when the plugin is switched off"
msgstr "Panatilihing tumatakbo ang mga backup kapag naka-off ang plugin"

#: includes/class-admin.php:479
msgid "Off unless you turn it on. Keeps backups, restores and WP-CLI commands running if this plugin is switched off, or if a restored database no longer lists it as active. This puts a small loader in the must-use plugins folder."
msgstr "Naka-off maliban kung i-on mo ito. Pinapanatiling gumagana ang mga backup, pagpapanumbalik, at mga command ng WP-CLI kung naka-off ang plugin na ito, o kung hindi na ito nakalista bilang aktibo sa isang naipanumbalik na database. Naglalagay ito ng maliit na loader sa folder ng mga must-use plugin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:484
msgid "The loader is not in place. Save the settings to put it back."
msgstr "Wala sa tamang lugar ang loader. I-save ang mga setting upang ibalik ito."

#: includes/class-admin.php:490
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "I-save ang mga setting"

#: includes/class-archiver.php:52
msgid "A backup part could not be opened for writing. Check that wp-content has free space."
msgstr "Hindi mabuksan para sa pagsulat ang isang bahagi ng backup. Suriin kung may bakanteng espasyo ang wp-content."

#: includes/class-archiver.php:113
msgid "A backup part could not be written. Check that wp-content has free space."
msgstr "Hindi maisulat ang isang bahagi ng backup. Suriin kung may bakanteng espasyo ang wp-content."

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:42
msgid "Connect a storage destination on the Storage tab first: backups are kept in your own storage, not on this server."
msgstr "Magkonekta muna ng storage destination sa tab na Storage: ang mga backup ay itinatago sa sarili mong storage, hindi sa server na ito."

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:45
#: includes/class-restore-job.php:110
msgid "Multisite networks are not supported yet."
msgstr "Hindi pa suportado ang mga multisite network."

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:48
msgid "This server’s PHP has no ZipArchive extension. Ask your host to enable it."
msgstr "Walang ZipArchive extension ang PHP ng server na ito. Hilingin sa iyong host na i-enable ito."

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:98
msgid "Starting"
msgstr "Sinisimulan"

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:99
msgid "Listing files"
msgstr "Inililista ang mga file"

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:100
msgid "Backing up the database"
msgstr "Ibinaback up ang database"

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:101
msgid "Packing files"
msgstr "Ipinapakete ang mga file"

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:102
msgid "Uploading to your storage"
msgstr "Nag-a-upload sa iyong storage"

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:103
msgid "Finishing"
msgstr "Tinatapos"

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:123
msgid "The backup reached an unknown stage."
msgstr "Naabot ng backup ang isang hindi kilalang yugto."

#. translators: %s: backup id.
#: includes/class-backup-job.php:143
#, php-format
msgid "Backup %s started."
msgstr "Nagsimula na ang backup ng %s."

#. translators: 1: number of files, 2: total size.
#: includes/class-backup-job.php:168
#, php-format
msgid "Found %1$s files (%2$s)."
msgstr "Nahanap ang %1$s na (mga) file (%2$s)."

#. translators: 1: number of tables, 2: number of rows, 3: size.
#: includes/class-backup-job.php:209
#, php-format
msgid "Database: %1$d tables, %2$s rows, %3$s compressed."
msgstr "Database: %1$d mga talahanayan, %2$s mga hilera, %3$s naka-compress."

#. translators: 1: size of the backup, 2: number of destinations.
#: includes/class-backup-job.php:473
#, php-format
msgid "Backup complete: %1$s stored in %2$d destination."
msgid_plural "Backup complete: %1$s stored in %2$d destinations."
msgstr[0] "Kumpleto na ang backup: naimbak ang %1$s sa %2$d patutunguhan."
msgstr[1] "Kumpleto na ang backup: Na-store ang %1$s sa %2$d (na) destinasyon."

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:503
msgid "Some parts already uploaded could not be removed from your storage; they are in an incomplete backup folder and are never offered for restore."
msgstr "Ang ilang bahaging na-upload na ay hindi maalis sa iyong storage; ang mga ito ay nasa isang folder ng hindi kumpletong backup at hindi kailanman iniaalok para sa pag-restore."

#: includes/class-backup-job.php:520
msgid "A storage destination was removed while the backup was running."
msgstr "Inalis ang isang imbakan habang tumatakbo ang backup."

#: includes/class-catalog.php:134
msgid "That is not a backup folder."
msgstr "Hindi iyon backup folder."

#: includes/class-catalog.php:138
#: includes/class-restore-job.php:190
msgid "That storage destination is no longer saved on this site."
msgstr "Hindi na naka-save sa site na ito ang destinasyon ng imbakan na iyon."

#: includes/class-catalog.php:141
msgid "Later incremental backups are built on this one. Delete those first."
msgstr "Ang mga susunod na incremental backup ay nakabatay dito. Burahin muna ang mga iyon."

#: includes/class-cli.php:313
#: includes/class-connection-keys.php:182
#: includes/class-settings.php:241
msgid "No destination with that id. See: wp zinn-backups destination list"
msgstr "Walang destinasyon na may ganyang ID. Tingnan ang: wp zinn-backups destination list"

#: includes/class-cli.php:391
msgid "Use: wp zinn-backups key set|get|remove [<name>]"
msgstr "Paggamit: wp zinn-backups key set|get|remove [<name>]"

#: includes/class-cli.php:395
msgid "Do not put a key on the command line. Pipe it in on STDIN, or name an environment variable with --from-env."
msgstr "Huwag maglagay ng key sa command line. I-pipe ito sa STDIN, o pangalanan ang isang environment variable gamit ang --from-env."

#. translators: 1: key name, 2: destination id, 3: the key with all but its last characters hidden.
#: includes/class-cli.php:414
#, php-format
msgid "Saved %1$s for destination %2$s: %3$s"
msgstr "Nai-save ang %1$s para sa destinasyong %2$s: %3$s"

#. translators: 1: key name, 2: destination id.
#: includes/class-cli.php:420
#, php-format
msgid "Remove %1$s from destination %2$s? Backups to it stop until a new one is set."
msgstr "Alisin ang %1$s mula sa destinasyong %2$s? Hihinto ang mga backup dito hanggang sa makapagtakda ka ng bago."

#. translators: 1: key name, 2: destination id.
#: includes/class-cli.php:425
#, php-format
msgid "Removed %1$s from destination %2$s."
msgstr "Inalis ang %1$s mula sa destinasyong %2$s."

#: includes/class-cli.php:458
msgid "The loader is in place."
msgstr "Nasa tamang lugar ang loader."

#: includes/class-cli.php:458
msgid "The loader is removed."
msgstr "Inalis ang loader."

#: includes/class-cli.php:486
msgid "Use: wp zinn-backups loader status|install|remove"
msgstr "Paggamit: wp zinn-backups loader status|install|remove"

#: includes/class-cli.php:504
